WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,170 --> 00:00:04,170
Two old ladies exchange blood and sweat stamps

2
00:00:04,170 --> 00:00:08,490
Nie Chu, how dare you insult my ethics like this?

3
00:00:12,160 --> 00:00:14,160
You raised me. I didn’t take care of you just now, right?

4
00:00:14,160 --> 00:00:15,160
You still called me up?

5
00:00:17,060 --> 00:00:19,060
Old Wolf, you haven’t eaten yet

6
00:00:19,060 --> 00:00:22,060
Be more forceful and let them hold the gold coins tightly.

7
00:00:22,060 --> 00:00:25,060
Damn, that's the right thing to do

8
00:00:25,060 --> 00:00:32,310
How much will I give?

9
00:00:32,310 --> 00:00:34,310
Old wolf, I'm not talking about you

10
00:00:34,310 --> 00:00:36,310
How could you beat your boss like this?

11
00:00:36,310 --> 00:00:38,310
Shang'an should be more vigorous, right?

12
00:00:38,310 --> 00:00:40,310
You owe me five hundred thousand yuan

13
00:00:40,310 --> 00:00:42,310
Plus Lao Lang’s salary is one million

14
00:00:42,310 --> 00:00:44,310
There are also our mental damages and property expenses.

15
00:00:44,310 --> 00:00:45,310
I will give you a zero

16
00:00:45,310 --> 00:00:47,600
Five million is enough for us

17
00:00:47,600 --> 00:00:49,600
five million

18
00:00:49,600 --> 00:00:51,600
Why do you have an opinion?

19
00:00:51,600 --> 00:00:53,600
No, I gave it
